    "body": "Checked fetched upstream/main at 819ecfc310402d82bc4df22ce4273d9ef93eb772. The forward row-hover fix is already present from PR #1520 (commit 371db9c7, merged as fd2f4f30).\n\ngeo_page.rs sets geo_hover for the selection label, remove button and row rectangle. shell.rs transfers the ephemeral hover state and paints row_hover_segments with the named 3.5 px stroke and 7 px halo. Existing geo_row_hover tests cover face, chain and vertex rows, remove buttons, clearing on leave, viewport segments and distinct styles in both themes. I inspected these tests but did not run them in this check.\n\nReverse hover is tracked by open issue #1519. Before/after screenshots remain unverified. Stopping under the requested already-done check without a claim, branch or code change.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
