    "updated_at": "2026-11-14T21:47:55Z",
    "body": "Checked `upstream/main` at `5a474212`. This issue is already implemented on `upstream/main` from PR #1520 (commit `371db9c7`, merged as `fd2f4f30`).\n\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/geo_page.rs` (`chips`) sets `state.geo_hover` when hovering a selection label, its `×` remove button, or the row rectangle.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs` transfers `state.geo_hover` to `state.geo_hover_drawn`, requests a repaint when it changes, and paints `interact::row_hover_segments` using `Overlay::RowHover`, `interact::ROW_HOVER_PX` (`3.5`), and `interact::ROW_HOVER_HALO_PX` (`7.0`).\n- `crates/ui/src/interact.rs` (`feature_segments`) resolves faces, chains, patches, and vertices to viewport segments, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/ground_ink.rs` defines distinct `Overlay::RowHover` colors for light and dark themes.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/geo_row_hover.rs`, `crates/ui/src/law_tests.rs` (`row_hover_highlights_in_viewport`), and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/edge_click_modifiers.rs` cover row hover, remove-button hover, clearing on leave, and style constants (verified by inspection; tests were not executed in this read-only check).\n- Reverse hover is tracked in open issue #1519 (`in-review`), and desktop screenshots are already attached above.\n\nStopping without claiming or creating a branch.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
